    "detailed_description": "VInput is a plug-in for sending data to VTubeStudio. Support game controller, racing steering wheel, time data, hardware monitoring data and custom formula.<br><br><strong> Controller </strong><br>It supports full key detection of game controller. Tested devices include (XBox Controller, PS5 Controller)<br>Note: The Nintendo Switch Controller is special and can only be used after key mapping in steam.<br>Support common racing steering wheel.<br><br><strong> Time data </strong><br>Support time data of year, month, day, hour, minute, second, millisecond, week and more.<br><br><strong> Hardware monitoring data </strong><br>It supports data such as occupancy, frequency and temperature of hardware devices such as motherboard, CPU, graphics card and hard disk.<br><br><strong> Custom Formula </strong><br>For complex requirements, such as the position of fingers on the fine control handle, you can use the custom formula function to calculate and output the existing data.<br>The output of the formula itself can also be used as input by other formulas.<br>Because formulas are scripts in Lua language in essence, you can write complex judgment logic in addition to formulas.<br><br>QQ Group:751202335 enter password:123<br><br><i>Model in video is not included</i>",
